{"id":"lm-68339453ec565eca6fadb6fb","title":"A Learnable Meta Russia Cars (Gen 3)","group":"LM Europe","desc":"learnablemeta.com map","cards":[{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/WZmS80VuLr4CExsXFUiggMm4z063ie8YHZMZ.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/GHwBdKglBZf06tu3QJD4eGDp97NxZ6DzHtoo.avif"],"a":"Long Black A-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The A-Type long antenna has its highest ridge on the right.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/xcgeam0mj9qxWuQAaJS9bNsCCzcMQZC9GN18.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/Ib2Fud8UOCafQVpPI2ArdKTlSUlY1Ej6xYhi.avif"],"a":"Long Black B-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The B-Type long antenna has its highest ridge on the left.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/pDbBcdSlvNktvdVVt53QPcv8Fdk2mnSB6ayt.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/50cQ7rVTxg13NJWRM650ZVhFamL2dQc2xHpf.avif"],"a":"Long Black CA-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The CA-type long antenna can be thought of as a low A-type or a “twisting antenna” with the ridges being further from the top.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/Dzj9f2DCYkovY7Y9zPxB6lHmGVI1Ct129wW5.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/0h6JHDtgwmlkTw2aPukxUrvbtbkv6ZZ1m2xN.avif"],"a":"Long Black CB-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The CB-type long antenna can be thought of as a low B-type or a “twisting antenna” with the ridges being further from the top.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/tyy8l1NX84JejdHzg1opu6jYuKEQfGshqsAn.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/43BBDiLKNHq1i6z7jDI7XG7OKU7TZZXMiRvB.avif"],"a":"Long Black Very A-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The Very A-Type long antenna has a drastically more curved topmost ridge on the right.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/QpZ9OExdJ5u2Hw8ZGzl0Loduwb8FFEjNewza.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/UJ7xBFNJ9uCjfBOmhSGSq7SXhLrXIqAe37Re.avif"],"a":"Long Black Very B-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The Very B-Type long antenna has a drastically more curved topmost ridge on the left.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/X5wN7j4IijLk4INeKg5X5CNTzDE5IOaG426m.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/HkDe7Vp8TakED56RHOxXbt3qRqX1u97SKgLq.avif"],"a":"Long Blurred","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The blurred long antenna is visibly blurrier than any of the other long antennas.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/vnXIvB8GgG1yJTbPa70ZQ1sbyabV5Dfrcurh.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/W3ZNG43zAwj2NQmupFMvRpaTrDol19HW3EyS.avif"],"a":"Long Megalong","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The Megalong antenna has more right ridges (9/10) then a normal long antenna (7/8).</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/v82Q81PSkab5wVvm5sNlfEIhxWTfnpPqvxw3.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/CzhoWn99QVsp6MfEWjVfyrt5zuTYpl8Bfq6w.avif"],"a":"Long White/Silver Very A-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>White/Silver car with The A-Type long antenna.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/xIkdeB3O0qwn11Q5nxAzlUN3hj9PxyQmFMrI.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/EXqDLsKQT7ybaXYQruimvxi0GPuyKdLCwTLE.avif"],"a":"Long White/Silver Very B-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>White/Silver car with The B-Type long antenna.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/4cfcmL4cI8eREN2z3Lyc1U9yNv556CynxU42PCMvXZYAvQPa.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/qfOZiahBNbyAuUgpHUZd7eo1cG6z6e3gHARoC5dPCQipB6cj.avif"],"a":"Short A-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The A-type short antenna has its highest ridge on the right.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/Sj6zEcIDye8FMr9PNnEnHcNVwdIRjOt6Ln3M.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/6KW1vx0L6jKsYvM63PFRZBWL30DpDRAT4D24.avif"],"a":"Short B-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The B-type short antenna has its highest ridge on the left</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/JdxzXoztgPOF1ec4DZPcI8a5KbxnsqT5zwE2.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/pYFYz5AUxWAzOy6wSpvx8ZmjabI4Amzj5DN3.avif"],"a":"Short B-Type Pronounced","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The B-type pronounced antenna is the same as the B-type antenna but the ridge is more “rectangular”.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/5r9KNeXBi31pLIKLPrDmmHDl8FLsGxoStcFx.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/15ZdG4dwn1q7Jhg4RpMMz1s7karHeUPT58pH.avif"],"a":"Short Blurred","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The blurred short antenna is visibly blurrier than any of the other short antennas.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/UKWcMqzPmK51CXBcYdcM4EKvbYyj58jJXWdg.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/UkMsyl225Mg5duhGacT71ziDmntLUmMJmqfL.avif"],"a":"Short C-Type","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The C-type short antenna can be thought of as a low A-type or a “twisting antenna” with the ridges being further from the top.</p>"},{"q":["https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/10UL99QlxODtwO2ynmj0WnszlcaGDRRG0QLF.avif","https://learnablemeta.com/images/1453/eYdJBpzhW52KdJxLxAH7E0CiU8DWvnQ2SHRs.avif"],"a":"Short Tilted","slug":"russia","note":"<p>The tilted short antenna is visibly tilted.</p>"}]}